            "name": "Explorations- Student Research, Scholarship & Creative Expression",
            "description": "<p class=\"cvGsUA direction-ltr align-center para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">The Cheng Library &amp; the SGA Academic Affairs Committee are proud to celebrate Student Research, Scholarship &amp; Creative Expression!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"cvGsUA direction-ltr align-center para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Student Research, Scholarship &amp; Creative works will be displayed in the Library April 20th-May 1st.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"cvGsUA direction-ltr align-center para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Research Papers, posters, PowerPoint presentations, music, films, photography, and artwork are all accepted!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"cvGsUA direction-ltr align-center para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Submit your work to join the celebration.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"cvGsUA direction-ltr align-center para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Student work will be displayed in Library Display cases and other designated spaces for viewing by the University Community.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"cvGsUA direction-ltr align-center para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Tier 3 LEARN Badge credit if your work is selected!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"cvGsUA direction-ltr align-center para-style-body\"><strong><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\"><a href=\"https://wpunj.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_eWlOwgALtONH40K\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here to Submit your Work!</a></span></strong></p>",
